            {"question":"Which sequence correctly represents the maternal health program?","options":["Antenatal → Premarital → Natal → Postnatal","Premarital → Antenatal → Natal → Postnatal","Natal → Antenatal → Premarital → Postnatal","Premarital → Natal → Postnatal → Antenatal"],"answer":"Premarital → Antenatal → Natal → Postnatal"},
            {"question":"Which statement about family planning is MOST correct?","options":["It aims to prevent every pregnancy","It aims to improve pregnancy planning and spacing","It is limited to postnatal care","It excludes contraception"],"answer":"It aims to improve pregnancy planning and spacing"},
