            {"question":"A nurse begins counseling a couple using the GATHER model. Which sequence is correct?","options":["Greet → Ask → Tell → Help → Explain → Return","Ask → Greet → Help → Tell → Explain → Return","Greet → Tell → Ask → Return → Help → Explain","Help → Ask → Greet → Explain → Tell → Return"],"answer":"Greet → Ask → Tell → Help → Explain → Return"},
