            {"question":"According to the lecture, accidents are the:","options":["First leading cause of death in elderly people","Third leading cause of death in elderly people","Fifth leading cause of death in elderly people","Tenth leading cause of death in elderly people"],"answer":"Fifth leading cause of death in elderly people"},
            {"question":"Which group includes examples of accidents mentioned in the lecture?","options":["Falls, motor vehicle accidents, fires, and contact with hot substances","Falls, infections, cancer, and diabetes","Burns, hypertension, fractures, and dementia","Falls, stroke, arthritis, and cancer"],"answer":"Falls, motor vehicle accidents, fires, and contact with hot substances"},
