            {"question":"Which statement about environmental hazards is MOST correct according to the lecture?","options":["Only physical hazards require nursing attention.","Environmental hazards include physical, biological, chemical, thermal, and psychosocial hazards.","Only biological hazards can harm elderly people.","Psychosocial hazards are unrelated to environmental safety."],"answer":"Environmental hazards include physical, biological, chemical, thermal, and psychosocial hazards."},
