            {"question":"An elderly patient reports joint stiffness after sitting in a car for a prolonged period. According to the lecture, this stiffness usually:","options":["Persists for several hours","Resolves within 30 minutes of light activity","Requires complete bed rest","Progressively worsens with light activity"],"answer":"Resolves within 30 minutes of light activity"},
